polyglot
--------

Parts of SQLQuack's tokenizer and parser, in crates/sqlquack-syntax and
crates/sqlquack-syntax-derive, are derived from polyglot (https://github.com/tobilg/polyglot),
as forked at https://github.com/sqlstack-io/polyglot. The exact-check corpus
corpora/polyglot-check/polyglot_tests.json holds the SQL inputs of polyglot's tests.
SQLQuack's DuckDB result-type rules, in crates/sqlquack-semantics/src/lineage/_helpers/duckdb_typing.rs
and duckdb_types.rs, are ported from polyglot's engine type rules, and the fixture
crates/sqlquack-semantics/src/lineage/tests/fixtures/duckdb_engine_types.json is polyglot's
tests/fixtures/engine_types/duckdb.json, the result types DuckDB bound for its synthetic cases.

